or even if I was going to have a part.Look dad.

268
00:18:54,900 --> 00:18:56,380
如果你让我卑躬屈膝,我就卑躬屈膝.
If you want me to grovel, I'll grovel.

269
00:19:02,560 --> 00:19:03,880
杰森:欢迎回家,迈克.
Jason: Welcome home mike.

270
00:19:08,520 --> 00:19:13,220
麦琪:哦,你回来我真高兴.我甚至不介意你身上的臭味.
Maggie: Oh, I'm so glad you're home.I don't even mind if you smell.

271
00:19:15,360 --> 00:19:17,420
杰森:你知道我正关注波顿学院的课程,那里有个戏剧小组,
Jason: you know I was noticing in that Boynton catalogue,

272
00:19:18,080 --> 00:19:21,540
叫波顿大学演出团.
that there's a little theatre group there called the Boynton College Players.

273
00:19:22,200 --> 00:19:23,520
开萝尔:别推我!
Carol: Don't push me!

274
00:19:23,520 --> 00:19:23,620
麦琪:开萝尔.
Maggie: Carol.

275
00:19:25,140 --> 00:19:27,320
迈克:哦,等等,如果她回来,这个交易取消.我搬出去.
Mike: Oh wait, if she's back the deals off.I'm moving out.

276
00:19:30,420 --> 00:19:32,800
开萝尔:你想怎么对我都行,但是这是我的城市.
Carol: You can do what you want to me but it's my city.

277
00:19:33,080 --> 00:19:34,260
这永远都是我的城市.
It will always be my city.

278
00:19:34,380 --> 00:19:35,340
杰森:这怎么回事?
Jason: What's going on here.

279
00:19:35,380 --> 00:19:38,680
埃迪:我们在五十八号大街逮住她玩三张纸牌的游戏.
Ed: We caught her playing three card Monty on fifty Eighth Street.

280
00:19:39,020 --> 00:19:40,040
开萝尔:我赢了.
Carol: I was winning.

281
00:19:40,680 --> 00:19:42,040
埃迪:进自己的房间,小姐.
Ed: Go to your room young lady.

282
00:19:42,480 --> 00:19:45,200
麦琪:爸爸.只有父母才可以叫小孩回房间.
Maggie: Dad.Only a parent can tell a child to go to her room.

283
00:19:45,540 --> 00:19:47,840
埃迪:好呀.玛格丽特,去你的房间.
Ed: Fine.Margaret, go to your room then.

284
00:19:49,560 --> 00:19:52,900
杰森:听好,埃迪,
Jason: Listen Ed, thank you for bringing our daughter home.We owe you one.

285
00:19:53,000 --> 00:19:53,900
谢谢你能把我的女儿带回家.我欠你一次.现在出去.
Now get out.

286
00:19:55,400 --> 00:20:02,400
埃迪:你相信吗,凯特?我们把他们的孩子从鬼门关拉回来,而你急于赶我们走.
Ed: Did you believe that Kate.We pull their child from the jaws of hell and then you give us the bum's rush!

287
00:20:05,240 --> 00:20:10,160
奶奶:我们过的很开心.谢谢邀请我们.
Grandma: We had a wonderful time.Thank you for inviting us.

288
00:20:12,580 --> 00:20:14,600
开萝尔:你们两个不要骗我了.我知道你们派了一伙人来抓我.
Carol: You two don't fool me.I know you sent the goon squad to come and get me.

289
00:20:14,600 --> 00:20:21,600
杰森:开萝尔,打住.等会儿.我说,你回家我们很高兴,但是如果你不想待在家里.我们不会强迫你.你想走的话,走.
Jason: Carol, hold on.Wait a second.I mean we are glad to have you home, but if you don't want to stay, we're not going to force you.You want to go, go.

290
00:20:24,480 --> 00:20:25,900
开萝尔:再见.哦,你有坐出租车的钱吗?
Carol: see you.Oh, do you happen to have a cab fare?

291
00:20:25,900 --> 00:20:27,800
麦琪:没有.
Maggie: No.

292
00:20:27,800 --> 00:20:34,300
开萝尔:很好.这样我就待在这,直到死.
Carol: Great.So I am stuck here until I dye.

293
00:20:36,960 --> 00:20:39,360
麦琪:开萝尔,不管你怎么侮辱我们,
Maggie: Carol, no matter how much you insult us,

294
00:20:39,360 --> 00:20:40,800
你不会得到另外一张空白支票.
you are not going to get another blank cheque.

295
00:20:41,760 --> 00:20:42,820
开萝尔:这,我能至少试试吗?
Carol: well can I at least try?

296
00:20:43,980 --> 00:20:45,220
杰森:我告诉你我们要做什么.
Jason: I'll tell you what we will do.

297
00:20:45,820 --> 00:20:49,200
如果哥伦比亚大学有合适的宿舍,如果你感兴趣,
If a dorm becomes available at Columbia, if you're interested,

298
00:20:49,280 --> 00:20:50,760
那样我会帮你搬出去.
that's when we'll help you out.

299
00:20:51,760 --> 00:20:53,680
开萝尔:你想那样公平吗?
Carol: And you think that's fair?

300
00:20:54,820 --> 00:20:56,180
麦琪:是,我认为公平.
Maggie: Yes.We do.

301
00:20:58,560 --> 00:21:02,540
开萝尔:我本来想得到一张空白支票,但是我想这样我也能活.
Carol: well I'd prefer a blank cheque but I guess I can live with that.

302
00:21:05,360 --> 00:21:09,680
明天早上我就看太阳亲吻天空.
Tomorrow morning I'm going to watch the sun kiss the sky.

303
00:21:12,300 --> 00:21:18,000
杰森:现在我们四个孩子中的两个回来了.就满足她的要求吧.
Jason: Now we have two of our kids back.Part of her anyway.

304
00:21:20,540 --> 00:21:23,440
麦琪:我想,作为他们的父母,不仅仅变的更难.
Maggie: I wonder if being their parents didn't just get harder.

305
00:21:26,040 --> 00:21:29,820
奶奶:打断一下.埃迪想知道我们能不能拿走我们的行李?
Grandma: Excuse me.Ed wants to know if we can our luggage?

306
00:21:34,300 --> 00:21:37,100
斯丁克:本,在你有独立房间后,你真的变了.
Stinky: Ben, you've really changed since you got a place of your own.

307
00:21:40,220 --> 00:21:42,800
本:这可不仅仅是房间.这是娱乐活动的场所.
Ben: Well it's not just the place.It's the pre party excitement.

308
00:21:43,040 --> 00:21:44,480
宝贝们随时会过来.
The babes will be here any minute.

309
00:21:45,240 --> 00:21:48,900
斯丁克:宝,宝,宝,宝,宝,宝,宝贝?
Stinky: B, b, b, b, b, b, babes?

310
00:21:48,900 --> 00:21:52,300
本:欢迎来到本的娱乐宫,甜心.
Ben: Welcome to Ben's palace of pleasure you sweet thing.

311
00:21:52,300 --> 00:22:00,000
迈克:扁你了,蠢蛋.那个臭男人怎么了?哦,你一定带女孩子过来的.
Mike: Beat it you twerp.What happened to the stink man?Oh, you must have girls coming over.

312
00:22:00,000 --> 00:22:02,500
本:是的,我计划一个小晚会.
Ben: Yeah, I was planning a little party.

313
00:22:02,500 --> 00:22:05,600
迈克:没门,小混蛋.出去.
Mike: No way you little horn ball.You're out of here.

314
00:22:05,600 --> 00:22:09,900
本:哦,帮帮忙了,迈克.我求你了.女孩子随时会过来.
Ben: Oh come on Mike.I'm begging you.The babes will be here any minute.

315
00:22:12,280 --> 00:22:13,980
迈克:那么我们在谈什么?
Mike: So what are we talking here?

316
00:22:14,540 --> 00:22:20,420
本:我给你洗车.每天洗,一周,一年,先生.
Ben: I wash your car.Every day for a week.For a year, Sir.

317
00:22:23,280 --> 00:22:24,140
迈克:你可知道,本,回家真好.00:22:18,400
Mike: You know Bennie, its good to be home.
